---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Alexander May | Frontend Engineer"
description: "Frontend engineer with a security habit. 10 years building applications in Angular and TypeScript across Automotive, EdTech, and Insurance."
---
<!-- Structured Data -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "{{ site.author }}",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}",
  "jobTitle": "Frontend Engineer",
  "description": "Frontend engineer with a security habit",
  "knowsAbout": [
    "Angular",
    "TypeScript",
    "Tailwind CSS",
    "Testing Library",
    "Cybersecurity"
  ],
  "worksFor": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "codecentric",
    "url": "https://codecentric.de"
  },
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "addressLocality": "Munich",
    "addressCountry": "DE"
  },
  "sameAs": [{% for link in site.social %}
    "{{ link.url }}"{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<header class="section-box p-6 sm:p-12 mb-8 animate-slide-down">
  <span class="section-label" aria-hidden="true">001</span>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-8 items-start">
    <div>
      <h1
        class="text-[2rem] sm:text-[clamp(2.5rem,8vw,5rem)] font-extrabold leading-[0.9] -tracking-[0.03em] uppercase"
      >
        Alexander
        <span class="block text-brand-yellow">May</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg tracking-[0.2em] mt-6 opacity-70">
        Frontend engineer with a security habit
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-left lg:text-right text-xs tracking-widest">
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-start lg:justify-end gap-2 mb-2"
      >
        <span
          class="w-2 h-2 bg-brand-yellow not-motion-reduce:animate-pulse-dot"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></span>
        <span class="uppercase"
          >Munich <span aria-hidden="true">//</span> Germany</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
  <section
    class="lg:col-span-8 section-box not-motion-reduce:animate-slide-up"
    style="animation-delay: 0.1s"
    aria-labelledby="profile-heading"
  >
    <h2 id="profile-heading" class="section-label">
      <span aria-hidden="true">002 // </span>Profile
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg max-w-[60ch] mb-6">
      <s class="decoration-2 text-white/80 decoration-brand-yellow"
        >I build enterprise-grade systems that don't break.</s
      ><span class="sr-only"> (scratch that)</span>
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg max-w-[60ch] mb-6">
      I build calm, durable software and push back when complexity doesn't
      earn its keep.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg max-w-[60ch] mb-6">
      10 years building production systems across Automotive, EdTech, and
      Insurance.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg max-w-[60ch] mb-6">
      Currently at
      <a
        href="https://codecentric.de"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="text-brand-yellow font-bold underline decoration-brand-yellow underline-offset-4"
        >codecentric<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a
      >. Clients bring hard problems, I leave behind systems that last and
      teams that feel confident changing them.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg max-w-[60ch] mb-6">
      I specialize in
      <strong class="text-brand-yellow font-bold"
        >Angular/TypeScript</strong
      >
      ecosystems. Pragmatic beyond that.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg max-w-[60ch] mb-6">
      Currently working on my PJPT cert. Not as a career pivot, just
      because I believe you build better systems when you understand how
      they get taken apart.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg max-w-[60ch]">
      When not coding: lifting heavy things, obsessing over Neapolitan
      pizza, building (and breaking) my homelab, and D&amp;D campaigns.
    </p>
  </section>

  <aside
    class="lg:col-span-4 section-box not-motion-reduce:animate-slide-up"
    style="animation-delay: 0.2s"
    aria-labelledby="projects-heading"
  >
    <h2 id="projects-heading" class="section-label">
      <span aria-hidden="true">003 // </span>Last Projects
    </h2>
    {% for project in projects %}
    <article class="{{ 'pb-6' if loop.first else 'py-6' }}{{ ' border-b border-white/20' if not loop.last }}">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold leading-none text-brand-yellow">
        {{ project.name }}
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] mt-2 opacity-70 uppercase">
        {{ project.industry }}
      </p>
      {% if project.description %}
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] mt-2 opacity-70">
        {{ project.description }}
      </p>
      {% endif %}
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </aside>

  <section
    class="lg:col-span-8 section-box not-motion-reduce:animate-slide-up"
    style="animation-delay: 0.3s"
    aria-labelledby="stack-heading"
  >
    <h2 id="stack-heading" class="section-label">
      <span aria-hidden="true">004 // </span>How I work
    </h2>
    <div>
      <ul class="text-lg mb-6 list-none p-0" role="list">
        <li>
          I favor early, direct collaboration with UX over ticket-driven
          handoffs
        </li>
        <li>I prefer boring, readable systems over clever ones.</li>
        <li>I say no when I need to, and I explain why</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-lg mb-2">Current stack:</p>
      <ul
        class="text-lg md:flex gap-7 pl-6 md:pl-0 list-disc marker:text-brand-yellow"
        role="list"
      >
        <li class="font-bold md:marker:content-['']">Angular</li>
        <li class="font-bold">TypeScript</li>
        <li class="font-bold">Tailwind</li>
        <li class="font-bold">Testing Library</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav
    class="lg:col-span-4 section-box not-motion-reduce:animate-slide-up"
    style="animation-delay: 0.4s"
    aria-labelledby="connections-heading"
  >
    <h2 id="connections-heading" class="section-label">
      <span aria-hidden="true">005 // </span>Connections
    </h2>
    {% for link in site.social %}
    <a
      href="{{ link.url }}"
      class="link-item group"
      {% if link.external %}target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}
    >
      <span class="font-bold text-lg uppercase">{{ link.label }}</span>
      {% if link.external %}<span class="sr-only">(opens in new tab)</span>{% endif %}
      <span
        class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-[5px]"
        aria-hidden="true"
        >&rarr;</span
      >
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
    <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="link-item group">
      <span class="font-bold text-lg uppercase">Contact</span>
      <span
        class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-[5px]"
        aria-hidden="true"
        >&rarr;</span
      >
    </a>
  </nav>

  <section
    class="lg:col-span-12 section-box not-motion-reduce:animate-slide-up"
    style="animation-delay: 0.5s"
    aria-labelledby="blog-heading"
  >
    <h2 id="blog-heading" class="section-label">
      <span aria-hidden="true">006 // </span>Blog
    </h2>
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index0 < 3 %}
        {% include "post-card.njk" %}
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <p class="text-lg opacity-70">No posts yet. Check back soon.</p>
    {% endfor %}
    <a href="/blog" class="link-item group">
      <span class="font-bold text-lg uppercase">All Posts</span>
      <span
        class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-[5px]"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</main>
